<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups biotech ag stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups biotech ag stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said analyst Leonard Teitelbaum upgraded three biotechnology agriculture stocks to near-term accumulate from neutral and kept the long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The  three stocks include Delta and Pine Land Co, Pioneer Hi-Bred International Inc, and DeKalb Genetics Corp.</p>
<p>-- Delta shares rose 1-1/2 to 36-3/4, Pioneer gained 1-1/2 to 64-1/2, and deKalb jumped 1-1/4 to 36-1/4.</p>
</text>
